      "severity": "high",
      "category": "gap",
      "title": "No path for invoices that are mid-finalization at cutover",
      "body": "The plan flips FINALIZE_VIA_QUEUE for all tenants at once. Invoices already picked up by the cron path keep running there while the queue path picks them up again, because both select status = 'open'.",
      "failure_scenario": "Deploy lands at 00:00:05 during the nightly run; ~1.2k invoices are finalized by both paths and get two PDF numbers.",
      "suggestion": "Add a 'finalizing' status claimed with SELECT ... FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED, and drain the cron path before flipping the flag.",
      "confidence": 8
